166	   * {@link #createCollection()}, which is the correct behavior for most implementations. The {@link
167	   * LinkedHashMultimap} class overrides it.
168	   *
169	   * @param key key to associate with values in the collection
170	   * @return an empty collection of values
171	   */
172	  Collection<V> createCollection(@ParametricNullness K key) {
173	    return createCollection();
174	  }
