### 1. InternetDomainName.java - duplicate lazy-initialization

The two methods are:
```java
private int publicSuffixIndex() {
    int publicSuffixIndexLocal = publicSuffixIndexCache;
    if (publicSuffixIndexLocal == SUFFIX_NOT_INITIALIZED) {
