160	 * on calls to {@link Cache#cleanUp}. Expired entries may be counted by {@link Cache#size}, but will
161	 * never be visible to read or write operations.
162	 *
163	 * <p>If {@link #weakKeys weakKeys}, {@link #weakValues weakValues}, or {@link #softValues
